{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QGgXEfBTsttFWY1L6j41KS","type":"tool_result","content":"kite:orange moth:orange ryu:orange ginga:orange moth:green ginga:white\nkite orange ef7d57,29366f,1a1c2c,f4f4f4,ffcd75,566c86\nmoth orange ef7d57,29366f,1a1c2c,f4f4f4,ffcd75,566c86\nryu orange ef7d57,29366f,1a1c2c,f4f4f4,ffcd75,566c86\n296:- `readonly palette: typeof PALETTE`\n801:type FilterGroup = 'shading' | 'era' | 'palette' | 'color' | 'display' | 'signal' | 'stylize'\n1053:             color transform, then every *art-pixel* filter (palettes, dither, colour\n1325:Restrained 16-color palette (Sweetie 16 by GrafxKid). Every color in a game should come\n1326:from here: authentic pixel art reads as \"designed\" because the palette is small.\n1374:Shared 3-band toon node material for a palette color, optionally textured and/or\n2700:- `colorAt(i: number): PaletteColor`: Current palette color name: stepped through the particle's color list.\n2706:squares), colors are palette names stepped over each particle's life (no blending).","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c060cbf0-9de2-4b69-aed6-69ef0ff7f0ee","uuid":"983aedae-034c-478f-826e-9f2346df6746","timestamp":"2026-11-06T01:44:46.993Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"kite:orange moth:orange ryu:orange ginga:orange moth:green ginga:white\nkite orange ef7d57,29366f,1a1c2c,f4f4f4,ffcd75,566c86\nmoth orange ef7d57,29366f,1a1c2c,f4f4f4,ffcd75,566c86\nryu orange ef7d57,29366f,1a1c2c,f4f4f4,ffcd75,566c86\n296:- `readonly palette: typeof PALETTE`\n801:type FilterGroup = 'shading' | 'era' | 'palette' | 'color' | 'display' | 'signal' | 'stylize'\n1053:             color transform, then every *art-pixel* filter (palettes, dither, colour\n1325:Restrained 16-color palette (Sweetie 16 by GrafxKid). Every color in a game should come\n1326:from here: authentic pixel art reads as \"designed\" because the palette is small.\n1374:Shared 3-band toon node material for a palette color, optionally textured and/or\n2700:- `colorAt(i: number): PaletteColor`: Current palette color name: stepped through the particle's color list.\n2706:squares), colors are palette names stepped over each particle's life (no blending).","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01QGgXEfBTsttFWY1L6j41KS","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
