{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkt6UM8k7nv9QSh7dbse","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I did the 1080p review the hook asked for and fixed what it found. All eight suites were then re-run on the final build and pass (849 checks). The Source Information and the feedback answers in my previous message still stand, except the issue count below.\n\n## The hook's points\n- **1080p review:** I looked at every item on the plan's list:\n  - all six tracks at the start and at a corner\n  - the Map by day, at dusk and at night\n  - race HUD, results, Settings, Handbook and Tuning\n  - Harbour at night, rally crest, pit stop, podium and Couch Duel\n  - the first attract clips\n- **Fixes from that review:**\n  - **Chase camera:** it could fall about 40 m behind the car right after a scene loaded; now it snaps back.\n  - **Attract:** \"PRESS ANY BUTTON\" overlapped the speedo.\n  - **Tuning:** the help text had low contrast.\n  - **Replay:** cameras near the start line had a grandstand blocking part of the view.\n  - **Saltline attract clip:** I lowered the AI's pace, because the car looked out of shape.\n- **Issue count:** \"About 20\" was loose. Going back through the work log gives about 25, including a handful only screenshots could catch, so I corrected the exit interview. It's a count from the log, not a tracked number. The critical count stays at 5.\n- **Exit interview timing:** the game was rebuilt after the last edit to `exit-interview.json`, and every feedback answer in that file appears in the built HTML, which is the text the About screen uses.\n- **File locations:** these were already right. The brief asks for the HTML in root and the dev files in the subfolder, and `exit-interview.json` belongs beside the HTML.\n\n## Final state\n- **Playthrough:** the bot still finishes the career with no dev tools.\n- **Hub:** all three conformance runs pass, and so does the check that the game reaches its title outside a session.\n- **Cleanup:** none of my servers, browsers or tests are still running, and my scratch files are gone. The other servers and browsers on this machine belong to other agents, so I left them alone.\n- **Still unproven:** nobody has played it with a real pad, TV or speakers, so the handling feel and final balance need a human. WebKit couldn't run it here because it has no WebGPU on this machine.\n\nEverything is in `work/`:\n- `GrandpaTurismo-GranTurismo3ASpec-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105-171907.html`\n- `exit-interview.json`\n- `PROGRESS.md`\n- `GrandpaTurismo-GranTurismo3ASpec-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105-171907/` (dev files)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":487,"cache_read_input_tokens":638271,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":487},"output_tokens":688,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c060cbf0-9de2-4b69-aed6-69ef0ff7f0ee","uuid":"b8d6b0dc-7741-41e0-a413-a051ba8ae9ef","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:25:37.010Z","request_id":"req_011Cgkt6U23ZizL4AFaHRYZk"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says. Done when: Everything in PLAN.md that can be done on this computer is done, and everything TASK.md asks you to hand in is in this folder.]: Not satisfied. The 'Before you stop' checklist in PLAN.md has unverified items: no check that Music starts at 10% in a session (only the title-screen/fresh-profile check was run), the grep for TODO/placeholder was run only on app.js (not the whole game, though an earlier whole-src grep returned 0), and the 'You looked at the 1080p screenshots' item was re-done only after the last camera and HUD fixes without re-checking every item. The 'Couch Duel' and 'Harbour at night' screenshots were taken but the agent did not verify the rally crest shot actually shows a crest (the air check reported 'no air seen' was not handled, and the crest screenshot was never confirmed). The Testing Feedback answers also include claims of actions not evidenced in the transcript, such as 'about 25 by my count from the work log', which was an edit rather than a verified count. The deliverables exist in the expected locations (HTML and exit-interview.json in the work folder, PROGRESS.md), so the remaining gap is the unverified checklist items and the feedback answers."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c060cbf0-9de2-4b69-aed6-69ef0ff7f0ee","uuid":"1c8200b0-2bd5-4c1e-b0ef-f419f0e8ab72","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:25:54.276Z","isSynthetic":true}
