{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkuE2m5qJ3yMFeGDfskH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've closed every point the hook raised, and checking the crest shot turned up one more real bug, now fixed. All eight suites pass on the final build (852 checks), including the full career playthrough and all three hub runs.\n\n## The hook's points\n\n| Item | Evidence now |\n| --- | --- |\n| Music at 10% in a session | New permanent check in the hub suite: every player's copy reads 0.1 in all three hub runs, and it passes. |\n| Grep for TODO, FIXME, placeholder, stub, coming soon | 0 hits across `src/game`, `src/main.js`, `src/index.html`, `docs` and the hub tags. |\n| Rally crest screenshot | I froze the game mid-air (0.38 m up at 82 km/h). The shot shows the car on the crest with its shadow dropping away, and the landing thump fired on touchdown. |\n| Testing Feedback count | It's now an itemised list of 30 issues in `PROGRESS.md`, with 5 marked critical and bugs in my own test scripts left out. The exit interview says 30. |\n\n## The bug the crest check found\nRed Clay's crests barely lifted the cars, about 0.16 m for 0.1 s at a time, so the landing dust and thump the plan asks for almost never fired. My old test passed anyway, because it only needed a few airborne frames.\n\nI shortened the crests from `[420, 36, 2.6]` and `[1660, 30, 2]` to `[420, 22, 2.6]` and `[1660, 18, 2]`. The first crest is now a real jump of about 1.2 s and 1.4 m in the Ryu Rally, though the second stays small because cars reach it at about 45 km/h. This changes the plan's track data, but the lap regression still passes. I recomputed the medal times, and the test now requires over half a second in the air.\n\n## What I didn't re-check\n- **Screenshots:** the full 1080p list was reviewed once. After that I only re-viewed what later fixes touched: Tuning, the Saltline clip, replay cameras, the crest and the About page. \"PRESS ANY BUTTON\" was checked on the Saltline clip only.\n- **After the crest change:** the only other rendering difference is the road shape on Red Clay, so I didn't re-shoot the other tracks.\n- **Landing dust:** I confirmed the thump fired, but no shot clearly shows the dust burst.\n- **Real hardware:** nobody has played it with a real pad, TV or speakers, so handling feel and final balance still need a human. WebKit can't run it here because it has no WebGPU on this machine.\n\nThe earlier Source Information and feedback answers still stand, with the count now 30. The game was rebuilt after the last exit-interview edit, and all its feedback answers are in the built HTML. No servers of mine are still running, and my scratch files are gone.\n\nEverything is in `work/`:\n- `GrandpaTurismo-GranTurismo3ASpec-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105-171907.html`\n- `exit-interview.json`\n- `PROGRESS.md`\n- `GrandpaTurismo-GranTurismo3ASpec-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105-171907/` (dev files)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":738,"cache_read_input_tokens":652316,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":738},"output_tokens":755,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c060cbf0-9de2-4b69-aed6-69ef0ff7f0ee","uuid":"6a6fe400-f98a-470d-b88a-17f60eb9d04c","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:40:27.207Z","request_id":"req_011CgkuE2RFEgTKg2CkkFo4b"}
