{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgm2zVzEVekZGUWyjeQWq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The game is finished and handed in, and I've done everything on the plan that this computer allows. All eight suites pass on the final build (`d198c8f305d6`, 867 checks), and none of my servers or browsers are still running.\n\n## The hook's latest points\n| Point | Outcome |\n| --- | --- |\n| Playthrough not logged on the final build | Fixed. On this build the bot finished on day 29 with 432,800 CR and reached the ending. |\n| Dell's subtitle covering the replay labels | Fixed. It now sits above the bottom strip, confirmed by screenshot and a new test. |\n| Issue count | The numbers 1–33 are all present, and the group sizes add up to 33, checked by script. Every feedback answer is in the built game. |\n| Checklist per plan item | Written out item by item, with evidence, in `PROGRESS.md`. |\n\n## Limits that remain\n- **Issue list:** it's my own record of this session, and nothing outside this session can confirm it. A script can only show the list is complete and adds up, not that I remembered every issue.\n- **Screenshot review:** I shot the whole list on this build with no errors, but only looked at part of it: the track corners, crest, Map, HUD, results, replay, Couch Duel, attract clips, podium, prize and ending. The 14 cars and the remaining menus I last looked at on the previous build; the only game code changed since then is the replay subtitle's position. I reviewed these myself, so nobody else has checked that judgement.\n- **Real hardware and players:** a real pad, TV, speakers, a human driver and iOS Safari aren't available here, and the plan says they're never required. So handling feel and difficulty are unproven. WebKit can't run the game here because it has no WebGPU.\n\nThis is as far as checking on this machine can go, so the next step is for someone to play it on a real pad.\n\nEverything is in `work/`:\n- `GrandpaTurismo-GranTurismo3ASpec-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105-171907.html`\n- `exit-interview.json`\n- `PROGRESS.md`\n- `GrandpaTurismo-GranTurismo3ASpec-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105-171907/` (dev files)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":952,"cache_read_input_tokens":762863,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":952},"output_tokens":722,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c060cbf0-9de2-4b69-aed6-69ef0ff7f0ee","uuid":"542bf18f-21c0-466b-836b-37f9670add41","timestamp":"2026-11-06T04:22:15.810Z","request_id":"req_011Cgm2zVZvvMN2Xb1rMzamb"}
