{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgm3SAqneJx6jjzagb6cE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The whole 1080p list has now been reviewed on the final build (`d198c8f305d6`), so every item on the plan's \"Before you stop\" checklist is met. All eight suites pass with 867 checks, and no code changed during this review.\n\n## \"Before you stop\" checklist (PLAN.md section 18), item by item\n\n| # | Plan item | Result on this build |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | `node tools/test.mjs` all green, hub passing all three runs | ✅ 867 passed, 0 failed. Hub passes with 2 players, 4 players on a bad network, and host-leave. |\n| 2 | Scripted playthrough finishes the career with no Dev tools | ✅ Reached the ending on day 29 with 432,800 CR, and the test confirms dev tools stayed off. The bot drove at 0.97 skill, not the plan's 1.0. |\n| 3 | HTML runs from `file://`, `session.js` unmodified and first, engine unedited | ✅ The browser suite runs from `file://` and checks the client comes first. The client's text is in the HTML byte for byte. The engine matched the release when I compared them, and I haven't edited it since. |\n| 4 | Music at 10% on a fresh profile and in a session | ✅ Tested on a fresh profile in the headless and browser suites, and in a session in all three hub runs. |\n| 5 | Grep for `TODO`, `FIXME`, `placeholder`, `stub`, `coming soon` | ✅ 0 hits in the game code, docs and hub tags. |\n| 6 | Every menu item works; every car, track, test and event reachable | ✅ Covered by the data, headless, browser and playthrough suites. |\n| 7 | Looked at the 1080p screenshots | ✅ All viewed on this build, with no console errors: 14 cars, 6 tracks at start and corner, hikers, rally crest in the air and on landing, 3 Maps, all menus, HUD, results, replay, Couch Duel, Harbour at night, 10 attract clips, pit stop, podium, prize and ending. |\n| 8 | About shows real answers, exit interview parses, chat reply matches | ✅ The file parses, and a script confirmed every feedback answer is in the build. My earlier replies carry the same information, with the issue count now 33. |\n| 9 | No stray servers or browsers of mine | ✅ Checked; none running. |\n\nI checked these myself; there's no independent sign-off. A few things stop short of a plain \"done\":\n- **Issue list:** the 33 issues are my own record of this session. A script confirmed the list is complete and adds up, but nothing here can confirm I caught every issue.\n- **Real hardware and players:** a real pad, TV, speakers, a human driver and iOS Safari don't exist on this machine, and the plan says they're never required. Handling feel and difficulty are unproven until someone plays it. WebKit can't run the game here because it has no WebGPU.\n- **Changes to the plan's numbers:** these are listed in `PROGRESS.md`: AI pace, prizes, Red Clay crests, slide wear and the Saltline reference times.\n\nEverything is in `work/`:\n- `GrandpaTurismo-GranTurismo3ASpec-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105-171907.html`\n- `exit-interview.json`\n- `PROGRESS.md`\n- `GrandpaTurismo-GranTurismo3ASpec-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105-171907/` (dev files)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1730,"cache_read_input_tokens":769652,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1730},"output_tokens":784,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c060cbf0-9de2-4b69-aed6-69ef0ff7f0ee","uuid":"61f7019c-a2ce-493f-906a-ce8c70ba6c41","timestamp":"2026-11-06T04:28:07.128Z","request_id":"req_011Cgm3SARizy8voXeomdvj4"}
