{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgm4t6UwEyCP86ScGGd97","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The balance check I could still run here passes on the final build (`340671411728`, unchanged, 867 checks). The career can be finished by a much less perfect driver, so I consider this complete.\n\n## Balance with a less perfect driver\nSo far the bot had only played at 0.97 skill. I ran the whole career again at 0.92:\n\n| Result | Detail |\n| --- | --- |\n| Licences | All three passed |\n| Won at the first attempt | Dawn Patrol, Fellowship, Red Clay Rally, Touring Trophy, Harbour 200, Grand Prix |\n| Harder | Featherweight took three attempts |\n| Not won | Rear-Drive Society, lost three times |\n| Ending | Reached on day 36 with 317,200 CR (day 29 at 0.97) |\n\nThe difficulty rises sensibly, and a slower driver takes longer rather than getting stuck. I left Rear-Drive Society as it is: the Grand Prix doesn't need it, and the bot's fixed script only ever entered a lightly tuned Ginga. It never added power or bought the Brandt, which also qualifies. This run isn't part of the test suite, because that one failed check comes from the script, not from a game fault; the result is recorded in `PROGRESS.md`.\n\n## What can't be settled here\n- **Feel:** it can only be judged by a person. The nearest stand-ins all pass: the keyboard-style driver regression, the playthrough driving through the pad input layer, and the balance run above.\n- **Real hardware:** the plan says a real pad, TV and listener are never required, and this machine has none.\n- **Feedback answers:** I re-read them against what happened and corrected two sentences, but this is my own account. Nobody else has checked it, and I can't arrange that from here.\n\nFurther runs wouldn't change any of this, so I'm stopping here. The next useful step is someone playing it on a real pad, starting with handling feel and Rear-Drive Society's difficulty.\n\nThe Source Information and feedback answers in my previous message are final. Everything is in `work/`:\n- `GrandpaTurismo-GranTurismo3ASpec-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105-171907.html`\n- `exit-interview.json`\n- `PROGRESS.md`\n- `GrandpaTurismo-GranTurismo3ASpec-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105-171907/` (dev files)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":838,"cache_read_input_tokens":780491,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":838},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c060cbf0-9de2-4b69-aed6-69ef0ff7f0ee","uuid":"372c55b7-6af1-4cbe-90fa-8de0f6029836","timestamp":"2026-11-06T04:47:04.468Z","request_id":"req_011Cgm4t5ygDKpvFPWkfS8ys"}
